{%- comment -%}
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GIFT WRAP OPTION (cart drawer: sections/cart-drawer.liquid · cart page: sections/main-cart.liquid "Gift wrap" block)
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
One paid add-on covering gift wrap AND a message together, as a single cart line (not a bundle, not per line item:
whatever's in the basket gets wrapped as one order). Ticking the checkbox adds `product_handle`'s product to the
basket; the message box (shown once ticked) writes a "Gift message" line item property onto that same line via
cart/change.js, so it travels with the order to the packing slip/notification rather than living as a separate cart
attribute. Behaviour: the <gift-wrap-option> custom element in voxblock.js (GIFT WRAP OPTION section).
Needs: a real product (one variant, inventory not tracked) created once in Admin; its handle is passed in.

Supported variables:
* product_handle: handle of the gift-wrap product (required)
* max_length: optional max length for the message box
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign gift_product = all_products[product_handle]
  assign variant = gift_product.variants.first
-%}

{%- if variant != blank and variant.available -%}
  {%- liquid
    assign existing_item = blank
    for item in cart.items
      if item.variant_id == variant.id
        assign existing_item = item
      endif
    endfor
    assign is_added = false
    if existing_item != blank
      assign is_added = true
    endif
  -%}

  {%- assign formatted_price = variant.price | money -%}

  <gift-wrap-option class="gift-wrap-option v-stack gap-3" data-variant-id="{{ variant.id }}">
    <label class="gift-wrap-option__toggle h-stack items-center gap-3">
      <input type="checkbox" name="gift_wrap" {% if is_added %}checked{% endif %}>
      <span>{{ 'cart.gift_wrap.label_html' | t: price: formatted_price }}</span>
    </label>

    <div class="gift-wrap-option__message" {% unless is_added %}hidden{% endunless %}>
      {%- assign message_label = 'cart.gift_wrap.message_label' | t -%}
      {%- render 'input', name: 'gift_wrap_message', multiline: 3, label: message_label, value: existing_item.properties['Gift message'], maxlength: max_length -%}
    </div>
  </gift-wrap-option>
{%- endif -%}
